OL,3,GNEWSATeen's lost city archive found
OL,4,Aafter six decades in attic
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn 1963, 17-year-old Elizabeth Tyler
OL,7,Fwandered the streets of Coventry
OL,8,Fcapturing images of the city's bomb
OL,9,Fsites and abandoned buildings.
OL,11,FThe teenager, from Leamington Spa, had
OL,12,Fjust lost both of her parents suddenly
OL,13,Fleaving her homeless, and said
OL,14,Fphotography offered an escape from her
OL,15,Fown circumstances.
OL,17,FNow, aged 80 and living in southern
OL,18,FSweden, Tyler rediscovered the box of
OL,19,Fpictures, which has resulted in her
OL,20,Ffirst-ever photography exhibition and
OL,21,Fbook.
OL,23,APub: 03-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
